---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service – DSU Platinum"
  description="Terms of Service for DSU Platinum coaching and consulting services."
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to Home</a>

      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: November 2026</p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the website and services provided by DSU Platinum ("we", "us", or "our"). By accessing our website, booking a discovery call, or engaging with our coaching and consulting services, you agree to be bound by these Terms.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you do not agree with any part of these Terms, please do not use our website or services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Services</h2>
        <p>
          DSU Platinum provides online coaching, consulting, and mentoring services related to e-commerce, dropshipping, and digital entrepreneurship. Our services are delivered through one-on-one calls, group sessions, online courses, and digital resources.
        </p>
        <p>
          The specific scope, duration, and terms of each service offering are outlined at the time of purchase or enrollment.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Discovery Calls</h2>
        <p>
          Discovery calls are free, no-obligation consultations. By booking a call through our scheduling platform (e.g. Calendly), you agree to attend the call at the scheduled time. If you need to reschedule, please do so at least 24 hours in advance.
        </p>
        <p>
          Discovery calls are informational in nature and do not create a coaching or consulting agreement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. Eligibility</h2>
        <p>
          You must be at least 18 years of age to use our services or book a call. By using our website, you represent and warrant that you meet this age requirement.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Payments and Refunds</h2>
        <p>
          If you purchase a paid service or programme from DSU Platinum, the price and payment terms will be clearly disclosed before purchase. All payments are processed through our secure payment providers.
        </p>
        <p>
          Refund policies, if applicable, are specified in the individual programme agreement. Unless stated otherwise, all sales are final due to the digital and service-based nature of our offerings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          All content on this website and within our coaching materials — including text, graphics, logos, videos, course materials, and other media — is the property of DSU Platinum or its content creators and is protected by copyright and intellectual property laws.
        </p>
        <p>
          You may not copy, reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works from our content without prior written consent.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Results Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          The results and testimonials shared on our website or marketing materials represent the experiences of specific clients. They are not guarantees of future performance or income. Individual results vary based on effort, skill level, market conditions, and other factors.
        </p>
        <p>
          DSU Platinum does not guarantee any specific business outcome, income level, or financial result from using our services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. User Conduct</h2>
        <p>When using our website and services, you agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use our services for any unlawful or fraudulent purpose</li>
          <li>Interfere with or disrupt the operation of our website</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorised access to any part of our systems</li>
          <li>Share, resell, or redistribute our proprietary coaching materials without permission</li>
          <li>Harass, threaten, or behave disrespectfully towards our team or other clients</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, DSU Platinum shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of our website or services. Our total liability in connection with these Terms shall not exceed the amount you have paid us in the twelve months preceding the claim.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the content, privacy practices, or availability of these external sites. Your use of third-party services is at your own risk and subject to their respective terms and conditions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>11. Termination</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access to our services at any time, with or without notice, if we believe you have violated these Terms or engaged in behaviour that could harm our business or other users.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>12. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the applicable laws. Any disputes arising from these Terms shall be resolved through good-faith negotiation before resorting to formal proceedings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>13. Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these Terms from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date. Continued use of our website or services after any change constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>14. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us at:
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>DSU Platinum</strong><br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:info@dsu-platinum.com">info@dsu-platinum.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 40px 0 80px;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    color: var(--brand-500);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 5vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  ul {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  strong {
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  a {
    color: var(--brand-500);
  }

  a:hover {
    color: var(--brand-600);
  }
</style>
